  "hints": [
    {
      "tr": "Hiç alarm olmama olasılığı `(1 - alpha) ** m`.",
      "en": "The probability of no alarm is `(1 - alpha) ** m`."
    },
    {
      "tr": "Tersi: `1 - (1 - alpha) ** m`.",
      "en": "Its complement: `1 - (1 - alpha) ** m`."
    },
    {
      "tr": "Çözümün tamamı:\n\n```python\ndef family_error(m, alpha=0.05):\n    return round(1 - (1 - alpha) ** m, 3)\n\n\nprint(family_error(1))\nprint(family_error(20))\n```",
      "en": "The full solution:\n\n```python\ndef family_error(m, alpha=0.05):\n    return round(1 - (1 - alpha) ** m, 3)\n\n\nprint(family_error(1))\nprint(family_error(20))\n```"
    }
  ],
  "checks": [
    {
      "type": "function",
      "name": "family_error",
      "cases": [
        {
          "args": [
            1
          ],
